var USD_GATE_NOTE = "USD giveaways open with Stripe rails \u2014 campaigns, rosters, and draws work now, but USD payouts can't be recorded yet (the app has no payout-processor secret slot), so a USD giveaway stays in draft until those rails land. No money moves through the app.";
var SOLO_NO_COMPANY_ERROR = "Giveaways are a company-owner tool. Create a fleet first \u2014 My company \u2192 Create a fleet (Owner-Operator Gold/Diamond accounts can) \u2014 and add your drivers; then you can run a giveaway for your own roster here.";
